  "body": {
    "id": "lem:full-data-local-polynomial-control",
    "kind": "lemma",
    "statement": "Along every array with \\(N\\wedge T\\wedge\\min_s n_s\\to\\infty\\), the full-data selected local-polynomial construction has constants depending only on the fixed class constants such that, uniformly over \\(P\\in\\mathcal M_{N,T,\\mathbf n}^{\\dagger}(\\lambda)\\),\n\\[\n\\sum_{s=1}^{S}\\sum_{i=1}^{n_s}\n\\left[\\pi_s\\sum_{t=1}^{T}|\\bar a_{sti}|\\right]^2\n\\le C R_{\\mathrm{tr}}\n\\]\non successful fits,\n\\[\n\\left\\{\\mathbb E_P[A_L^2\\mathbf1_{\\mathrm{good}}\\mid E_0]\\right\\}^{1/2}\n\\le C\\{R_{\\mathrm{sm}}\\vee R_{\\mathrm{sp}}\\vee R_{\\mathrm{don}}\\}^{1/2},\n\\qquad\nP(\\mathrm{bad}\\mid E_0)\\le CR_\\star,\n\\]\nand the squared weighted generated-center displacement of the untreated surfaces is at most \\(CR_{\\mathrm{don}}\\) in conditional expectation.  These bounds remain valid when \\(Th_s^d=O(1)\\); no dense-local-site or logarithmic growth condition is required.",
    "free_symbols": [
      "N",
      "T",
      "n_s",
      "s",
      "P",
      "M_dagger",
      "lambda",
      "pi_s",
      "bar_a_sti",
      "R_tr",
      "A_L",
      "R_sm",
      "R_sp",
      "R_don",
      "E_0",
      "R_star",
      "h_s",
      "d"
    ],
    "depends_on": [
      "def:full-design-centered-class",
      "def:feasible-estimator",
      "def:honest-interval",
      "def:rate-frontier",
      "ass:holder-smoothness",
      "ass:design-density",
